    "sentence-category-reason": "Transforms a divisibility statement into an equation with an integer parameter k.",
    "sentence-category": "Implement"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "sentence": "If $m=1$, $(2-1)^2 = 1$, so $n-1 \\mid 1$, so $n-1=1$ and $n=2$.",
